@startuml
autoactivate on
autonumber

actor "System\nAdministrator" as Admin
participant ":System" as System

activate Admin

Admin -> System: asks to update description of a category
System --> Admin: shows all existing categories and \n asks to select the one to be updated

Admin -> System: selects the intended category
System --> Admin: shows description of the select category \n and requests the new description

Admin -> System: types the new description
System --> Admin: informs operation success

@enduml